# Probe 345/4c (lowering): merge of a model with one untyped written field `(y: 6)`; entry 7, 81 a wrong value.
Point:
    int: x 1
    int: y 2
end: Point
fn: build () int
    pack: merge(Point; (y: 6))
    return: pack\y * 10 + pack\x
end: build
int: code 7
if: build() != 61
    code: 81
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
